      "content": "that's a pretty optimistic outlook. but i'm a bit worried about the \"rule-based\" part. since you handle so many complex, non-linear variables like sudden weather shifts or port strikes, do you think a rule-based system will be able to handle the edge cases you currently manage? i'm wondering if there's a risk of cargo loss or major delays if the system isn't as \"intelligent\" as you are.",
